# Instagram feed (home page): create a free JSON feed at https://behold.so
# connected to @marniblythespeaks, then paste its URL here and restart dev /
# set the same variable in Vercel project settings for deploys.
NEXT_PUBLIC_IG_FEED_URL=

# Booking form backend (/api/inquiry): create a free API key at
# https://resend.com. Until this is set, the form falls back to opening a
# pre-filled email draft (mailto).
RESEND_API_KEY=
# Where inquiries are delivered (default: hello@marniblythespeaks.com)
INQUIRY_TO=
# Verified sender. Default onboarding@resend.dev works immediately for
# delivery to the Resend account owner; verify marniblythespeaks.com in
# Resend and switch this to hello@marniblythespeaks.com to enable the
# auto-acknowledgment email to planners.
INQUIRY_FROM=
